WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:15.803
"I must get to the construction site," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:20.503
"I have to find out what's causing the sinkholes!"

3
00:00:20.504 --> 00:00:22.664
She called over to her friends.

4
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:25.439
"Hey, guys! I'll be back.

5
00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:29.663
I, um, forgot my shin guards!"

6
00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:32.738
She hurried away from the soccer field.

7
00:00:32.739 --> 00:00:35.574
"But you don't need them!" Terrell called after her.

8
00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:38.595
"We're not having soccer practice!"

9
00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:40.823
Roxy was already gone.

10
00:00:40.824 --> 00:00:44.250
A second later Rocket Girl flashed through the sky.

11
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:51.201
"Look!" cried Mara. "It's Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:51.202 --> 00:00:53.636
Roxy flew over Metro City.

13
00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:56.091
She saw large holes everywhere.

14
00:00:56.091 --> 00:01:00.077
They looked like giant gopher holes.

15
00:01:00.078 --> 00:01:03.483
She spotted Detective Smith at the construction site.

16
00:01:03.484 --> 00:01:05.909
He was talking to two workers.

17
00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:09.034
Nearby stood a building that wasn't yet finished.

18
00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.684
The entire site was filled with large holes.

19
00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:15.421
Roxy landed next to the detective.

20
00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:19.049
"What's going on here, Detective?" she asked with a grin.

21
00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:22.677
"Are you digging for treasure?"

22
00:01:22.677 --> 00:01:24.477
Detective Smith frowned.

23
00:01:24.478 --> 00:01:31.436
"That's not funny, Rocket Girl. Something very strange is happening in Metro City."

24
00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:36.482
"I know," said Roxy. "Big sinkholes are everywhere.

25
00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:39.233
Does anyone know what caused them?"

26
00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:42.656
"We have no idea," said the detective.

27
00:01:42.656 --> 00:01:45.389
"But we need to find out right away.

28
00:01:45.389 --> 00:01:48.658
Things are disappearing into the holes!"

29
00:01:48.659 --> 00:01:53.662
"All the vehicles from this construction site are missing, right?" said Roxy.

30
00:01:53.662 --> 00:01:56.458
"Yep," said one of the workers.

31
00:01:56.459 --> 00:01:59.937
"Every dump truck, crane, and bulldozer!"

32
00:01:59.938 --> 00:02:03.591
"My car is gone too," said the other worker.

33
00:02:03.591 --> 00:02:05.771
She looked frightened.

34
00:02:05.772 --> 00:02:12.076
"It just sank into the ground!" She pointed to a big hole nearby.

35
00:02:12.077 --> 00:02:15.362
"Did you see it happen?" asked Detective Smith.

36
00:02:15.362 --> 00:02:19.630
The worker nodded. "First there was a loud rumble.

37
00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:24.365
The ground shook. It felt like a small earthquake.

38
00:02:24.365 --> 00:02:29.317
Then the hole appeared, and my car sank right into it!"

39
00:02:29.317 --> 00:02:34.580
Suddenly—rumble, rumble! The ground shook violently.

40
00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:41.688
"Oh no!" cried Detective Smith. "It's an earthquake!"

41
00:02:41.688 --> 00:02:46.749
The building wobbled. A big piece of steel fell from it.

42
00:02:46.749 --> 00:02:49.412
"Look out!" Roxy cried.

43
00:02:49.413 --> 00:02:52.743
Detective Smith and the workers ran out of the way.

44
00:02:52.743 --> 00:02:57.919
Roxy flew up and caught the piece of steel.

45
00:02:57.919 --> 00:03:02.490
"Whew!" she said as she laid it safely on the ground.

46
00:03:02.491 --> 00:03:05.838
"Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith called over the loud rumble.

47
00:03:05.839 --> 00:03:08.799
"What do you think is causing this earthquake?"

48
00:03:08.799 --> 00:03:11.731
"I don't know!" Roxy called back.

49
00:03:11.731 --> 00:03:15.098
"But we need to find out . . ."

50
00:03:15.099 --> 00:03:17.112
Roxy stopped talking.

51
00:03:17.144 --> 00:03:19.880
Her super ears were picking up a new sound.

52
00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:28.026
Beneath the loud rumble, she heard something very surprising—voices!
